><span class="smallnote">Select a week to jump to its calendar</span></div><div id="weeks" class="weeks"></div></div>
<div id="blocks-view" class="hide"><div class="toolbar"><div class="month-label">Training phases</div><span class="smallnote">Periodization is a guide, not a straightjacket</span></div><div class="block-grid" id="blocks"></div></div>
<div id="settings-view" class="hide"><div class="toolbar"><div class="month-label">Training settings</div></div><div class="settings-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Power & preferences</h3><div class="field"><label>Functional threshold power (watts)</label><input id="ftp" type="number" min="100" max="700"/></div><p class="smallnote">Your interval targets update with FTP. Workout percentages remain the same.</p><div class="callout">Rule of thumb: aim for two hard sessions per week, counting intense group rides and races. Move or remove structured workouts rather than stacking them.</div><div class="actions"><button class="button" id="reset">Reset calendar to original plan</button></div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Live power zones</h3><table class="zone-table" id="zones"></table></div></div><p class="smallnote" style="margin-top:20px">Version 1 saves changes locally in this browser. Use “Export plan” to back up your changes; there is no cloud sync yet.</p></div>
</div><div id="modalroot"></div>
